<!-- Tiraspolska Square (Тираспольська площа), put right against aerial imagery: the ring as wide as it is
     painted and its east side shared with Preobrazhenska, two lanes north into it rather than four, Nizhynska
     leaving it beside the tram, drawn along its gore-side edge, and Karavanskoho three lanes on into it.
     Read by the scanner over OSM's answer (src/tools/osmscan/Corrections.cs); opens in JOSM. Not for upload:
     read off Google's imagery, which OSM's licence does not let be traced into OSM. -->
